{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33172","headline":"山中晚兴寄裴侍御 · 司马扎","name":"山中晚兴寄裴侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雷息疎雨散，空山夏云晴。\n南轩对林晚，篱落新蛩鸣。\n白酒一樽满，坐歌天地清。\n十年身未闲，心在人间名。\n永怀君亲恩，久贱难退情。\n安得蓬丘侣，提携采瑶英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}